# Derek's ask, when 600 a day finished ~40 books and the pools stood at 13-35% of their week), when the chosen pool's
# weekly bucket is under the other lanes' reserve (agy-pools.mjs LANE_RESERVES, #7911) or its 5-hour bucket under 25%,
